From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:19:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Figs. 2 and 3: Task 14 as the newest default, version
 buttons, provenance in the result files

Fig. 3: data sets T5-T20 (Task 14 grating design + membrane modulation,
synchronous averaging) as default, results-version buttons (newest, Task 11,
set B, step 10, set A), size buttons that keep the version, per-set curve
names. Fig. 2: data set T14 as default; (f) shows the static fringe of the
same design and case (CMPC), the live cell follows the design; version
buttons. Both default to 10 mm, 3.3 um, R 97 %. Run files carry a meta
block (scripts/meta.js); results/MANIFEST.md lists scripts, files and
parameters per task.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLfEqncaEw1RGMDLUGdFgb
